AY7MzwhoviW1PgvmFY3RDufIuJ_QJI2jfeo-WSBeICsSKjJlSvw-C46FAwnwQZ7ts4OrvF6PeFM7fjvHRcmCU3Uke-NkJ-hq47TVwOHwoqSbaFC1yU6t7fI?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 410}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisie des résultats", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment saisir les résultats par date d'analyse", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour saisir les résultats par date d'analyse, cliquez sur"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Par Date de Test", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "By Test Date", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") dans le module Résultats."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur Par Date de Test", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 250, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeKKzPJlwDk5khv5cCjHmXLtWHniiih-RPYaiG71xItMKusPBdRWjRh2ysjTcwIV0IYv-ZyEjwhqNpNBE0_cqAFrpW9BLm3hYsCIXZJw7ChljlPFjaNDhlp4mz53LWCwK7mEk_x6RWuKlI-_5i0PnlFTkSD?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 308}}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Saisissez l'un des critères afin de limiter votre recherche."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "REMARQUE : la date de prélèvement et la date de réception doivent être au format jj/mm/aaaa. "}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Test Name, Test (Analysis)Statu ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "ou le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Statut de l'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sample Status", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") dans les listes déroulantes correspondantes. Une section de saisie des résultats s'affiche alors sur la page."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les critères et rechercher", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 250, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcAr9xm2R6cV5_K_bLAYjUUxCGQVS1p0j6RSl6DbW3XfBhhrJ_fvcQIvg17eeiPiqQKtAJ7YLNI1Kvi2m9ag9z0mCCxGh05qDiDMw72NRYk0tzdf6X0nuipPsoLdq-b_5VqF6xbw2y7HIs0MqUxYfeJFbg?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 645}}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment remplir la section de saisie des résultats.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La section de saisie des résultats vous permet de saisir les résultats, que la recherche soit faite par unité, par patient, par demande, par plage de numéros de demande ou par date d'analyse. Chaque analyse affiche les informations suivantes : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Lab Sample Info, Test Date, Analyzer, Test Name, Normal Range, Accept, Results, Current Result et Notes. ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Dans cet exemple, nous montrons une saisie des résultats "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Par Patient ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "en suivant les étapes 1 à 4 de la section"}, {"type": "text", "text": " comment saisir les résultats par patient", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/14Orpu7Ql3xF2-RmXE1AepnuyjpOyPVUQQ_ow_kaDrgs/edit#heading=h.pnv5nagavkjo"}}, {"type": "underline"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lorsque vous cliquez sur le patient souhaité, le système affiche un tableau qui vous permet de saisir les résultats. Utilisez la barre de défilement pour parcourir la page vers le haut et vers le bas afin de voir toutes les analyses du patient pour lesquelles vous pouvez saisir des résultats."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd_DQcrQEsoqLj9MKoe2a_9qFUbTIClrxw8zPLM3ucLJQz0tKeEPdigOqJ3yMEC35-cdCjmIaE0fCqhlU2jbp-0NEObwA6NXaOFNzZdHrWcqZSaGjHnb_odkxcew8ROP8V0jNl0S28j1gyU40WQ6ACj7rw?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 994}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Champs de résultats", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : les colonnes de saisie des résultats sont, de gauche à droite :  "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Lab Sample Info, Test Date, Analyzer, Test Name, Normal Range, Accept, Results, Current Result ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "et"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Notes.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dans cet exemple, nous saisissons les résultats de l'analyse en cochant la case Accept."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeqF1i9r-vZ-WSRvTGhZAJ7ul4TWIAUajx2o-pqy5Ao2gSV12zClq-p2smWry6Y8qs8az8k3yjeAdVhkqltyUztJKe7pB1v7gEr8sjPmictWc9lxMwS1-p-jnI9S3qKCQUkH3T4jYcyfVl93S5Z3ywCjBE1?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 994}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cocher la case Accept", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : la case Accept doit être cochée lorsque les résultats sont acceptés sans condition. Elle est prévue pour les cas suivants :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'analyse a été refaite et le résultat est identique "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'analyse n'a pas de résultat, mais vous ne souhaitez pas l'annuler."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le résultat a été modifié et le technicien de laboratoire veut permettre au biologiste d'ajouter, lors de la validation, une note expliquant la raison de la modification. "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "D'ACCORD", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "OK", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") dans la boîte de dialogue si les résultats de l'analyse sont acceptés sans condition."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcaC57_f9uXnb20-ruKOWSd2edG3q9ttjPZVGw2aQqYpUlW8Y6G2Kew4nMI1eiT6L7h88ukaTTfSnud0xowPFpNLvN_d-vHNcsBvKgG3SCb6LO9ZabsENKnUFZkLZQnCZFTyrX9kNCOY3ZpaiPm9Dn3okwi?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 727}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur D'ACCORD", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour les résultats numériques, saisissez le résultat. Pour les autres types, sélectionnez le résultat dans la liste déroulante ou saisissez-le dans la zone de texte"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez les résultats dans le champ de texte des résultats."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc_uzPjC6IFuN0Cn1dm7dJpLIojwuDpspRLzoK32m1_OkmXmd79-BIC83F2crlj9styLUZdEXg6x6zfo2okys9MY5yBTE-EWv_RZV-x62WHoAnaZDcPYLH-fAkvzouq9AsFnN2MxZlapO6sDvnl4xdg1Rk2?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 467}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les résultats", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Laissez une note expliquant la raison de l'action ci-dessus, puis cliquez sur le bouton"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Save", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfcAnzgEgVqvPyinkd5vqr1eHbLBqgqG6L8HTGeKOJDVhQOBc4ALc6yNESr3rB0mIjUYeWITjtk4f_SMRlUVotw0TvsO56tut0O-MNcDnXL-MdO3bgav19Ax3y9zz4dlL-pIsStTP5hAdnspF1t5A4LoBc?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 506}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les notes et cliquer sur Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un message de confirmation de l'enregistrement s'affiche en haut de la page."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdnAVL9fDgT4cCWZdebkz66IsXExZA4ZBC0suySBm1CMyPe7RKJj3pFXXQ-Ik4UzS7oALOgSPmBiOHQDuAHDOzsb6v39WsYN2b4Tm5GEHFuiRfi7y98q7Csd7GnbfWDDwD7cWNQ8Y0QVAeDCbsuBl5BArym?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 168}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrement réussi", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment envoyer une analyse à un autre laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si le technicien identifie une raison d'envoyer l'échantillon à un autre laboratoire pour une confirmation ou une autre analyse complémentaire, il clique sur la flèche > de l'analyse pour développer la section d'envoi. Dans cet exemple, nous reprenons une analyse de la section précédente."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeQUhFgiNPwzzn52afDbF6b8lw4n37GmOFeO9LhmjMhtE_5i9OzkHZ5-KSUZuivEUJr_6rHEu67fdMtrcnInK2rw-V5cvLt1YbxxaCJzDg9WskcpUd7-SgdjWdeRTCVKz0M8O2iAfuRo354YPB_RGDGLs8?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 480}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur une analyse pour développer la section d'envoi", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez la "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Méthodes", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Method", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), la"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Raison de référence", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Referral Reason", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), l'"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Institut", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Institute", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Test à effectuer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Test to perform", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") et la "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Date d'envoi", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sent Date", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), puis cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": " Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeSrWrQOpm_LBonj-t08vtFiD1jiZcdyvliDfp3u6Iou8S7OkrH_O2V1HWb2IHhcyNSHpDG7wzBRaTJTMMb0l7wjpGpmNmvn4s804gE5z7_wjbjwPvMS04K_eXMfluqMEj2DUgsTlUJdqSdD2iwnKetPSs?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 574}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les détails de l'envoi et cliquer sur Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un message de confirmation de l'enregistrement s'affiche en haut de la page."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdnAVL9fDgT4cCWZdebkz66IsXExZA4ZBC0suySBm1CMyPe7RKJj3pFXXQ-Ik4UzS7oALOgSPmBiOHQDuAHDOzsb6v39WsYN2b4Tm5GEHFuiRfi7y98q7Csd7GnbfWDDwD7cWNQ8Y0QVAeDCbsuBl5BArym?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 168}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrement réussi", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}], "version": 1}}